hydrogen2.dat 50000 ! name of file storing reactions, # of time steps (~31 RF periods at 1 MHz)
6. ! Te (eV)
6 ! # of levels in MG solver
1.d-8, 1.6d0 ! Min. precision in residual, w for SOR [1.6]
128 96 192 ! n: nx=2**n, ny=2**n. Number of grid points [2**7,2**3]
0. 16. 3.75 28.25 16.75 41.25 ! Particle heating region x<, x>, y<, y>, z<, z> [cm] - driver; coil radius R_ahp = yr - ymax/2 = 12.25 cm
40. ! Particle loading region [cm]
2 ! # of magnetic field files (<0 positive ions not magnetized)
128 96 128 ! Grid for the magnetic field map
n gauss 1. 75. By 8. 39. 0. 0. ! ext. file (y/n/s), name, scaling, B(G), direction, L/x0/y0/z0(cm)
s pegase128 1. 100. By 1. 0.53 0. 0. ! ext. file (y/n/s), name, scaling, B(G), direction, L/x0/y0/z0(cm)
60.d3 1.d8 ! Pabs(W): target RF power absorbed by the plasma (E0_RF is rescaled toward it), Heating frequency (unused with RF antenna)
-1.d0 2 ! Inject current I(A) (<0 == off), options [1=fixed, 2= equal to ion losses, 3= e-beam (+Z), 4= emmissive cath. (+Z), <0 cosine]
1.d-3 ! t_max(s)
0.3  ! time coeff. k ; dt= k*dx/vt
3.5d17 ! n0 (m-3)
5.d19 ! ng (m-3)
20 ! np_cell: number of particles per cell (<0 for no background plasma)
5 ! Number of wall labels, [ngrid+1:ngrid+2] is used for dielectric BC's (<0 do not save 3D density and potential maps)
1000 ! frequency for saving data (<0 does not reset averaging)
1000 -100 50.d-6 100.e-6 Z ! Frequency for simulation backup (<0 no averaging), # of plots (<0 off), time window [t1,t2], saved planes
36000.d0 ! k_eps0 (<0 iterative P, I_inj or Vgrd)
no 1 0. 8. 0. 12. 1 0. 12. ! Save pdf (y/n), ptype, yl, yr, zl, zr (cm), # of regions n_rg, xl & xr for each n_rg
no 48 2 1. ! Restart (yes/no/external/gauss),  # of OMP threads, # of MPI, coefficient for particle duplication/removal
no 0.8 0.8 1 2 3 ! Holes (y/n), Lhy*Lhz(cm), ny*nz holes, (PE) grid index
60. 1. 3 1.d-6 ! jH-(mA/cm2) from H on PE surface, TH-(eV), characteristics of neg. ions on grid # [index], dielectric capacitance Ca/S (Fd/m2)
-0.18 2 Wrapped 0. 1.d6 0. 0. 1.d3 ! Secondary emission coeff (<0 == off), grid index, RF mode (No/Electrode/Wrapped/Planar), phi0(V), f0(Hz), phi1(V), f1(Hz), E0_RF(V/m, initial guess) [, R_win(cm): Planar window radius]
no  ! Coulomb collisions (no/yes)
momentum ! Push scheme (momentum/energy) - EC-PIC (Powis & Kaganovich 2024) if 'energy'
END

